In plain words. Phi Framework is the compiled browser engine that Phi Browser
is built on. We publish it as a binary because the open source Phi Browser
clients need it to build and run. You may use it free of charge. You may pass
it along unchanged, with this License and with credit to us. It is not open
source. Do not modify it and do not take it apart, except where the law or a
third-party license gives you that right. It comes with no warranty of any
kind. Break these terms and your permission ends. This paragraph is a summary;
the terms below are the License.

